A '''Tewtil''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Tewtils''' spawn naturally in the water of {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}, primarily in the {{Zone|Tewtil Tunnel}} and {{Zone|Lotus Eater's Cave}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Tewtils''' float around and slowly move in water. They cannot be damaged from regular damage sources; instead, they must be fed {{Green|3}} [[Trophy Frogs]] to be exploded.

